# TerraFusion OS Commit Template
#
# Format: type(scope): concise summary (≤72 chars)
#
# Types: feat|fix|docs|chore|test|ci|revert|ai
# Scopes: consciousness|levy|sync|ui|api|data|config|security
#
# Example:
# feat(consciousness): add mesh health monitoring dashboard
#
# After the summary, include:
# - Optional detailed description
# - Evidence block (REQUIRED)
# - References to issues/tasks

type(scope):

# Detailed description (optional):
# - What changed and why?
# - Design decisions or context
# - Breaking changes or migration notes

Evidence:
- Tests:
- Logs:
- Metrics:

Refs:

# Co-authored-by: [Name] <email> (if pair programming or AI assistance)

# --- TerraFusion Elite Government OS Engineering Agent Standards ---
#
# Evidence Requirements:
# - Tests: Command executed and results (pass/fail counts)
# - Logs: Environment verification and error inspection
# - Metrics: Performance, accuracy, or resource impact measurements
#
# Examples:
# - Tests: dotnet test TerraFusion.Consciousness.Tests (42/42 passed)
# - Logs: Verified mesh coordination in dev-benton environment
# - Metrics: AI response latency P95: 45ms → 38ms improvement
#
# Government Standards:
# - All changes must demonstrate FISMA-High security compliance
# - County data isolation must be verified in testing evidence
# - Performance impact on citizen services must be assessed
#
# Government. Transcended.
